{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "03647",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.12,
      "end_seconds": 4.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "Hi, is it okay to come in now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.8,
      "end_seconds": 11.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.36,
      "text": "Of course, leave it there. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.13,
      "end_seconds": 17.82,
      "duration_seconds": 5.69,
      "text": "Honestly, it's a poor appetite, and my family pushed me to come."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.54,
      "end_seconds": 26.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "What's the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.63,
      "end_seconds": 42.27,
      "duration_seconds": 14.64,
      "text": "It's been two days, I'm fairly sure. I'd rather know what's going on than keep guessing. A neighbour of mine said I should see someone about it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 43.55,
      "end_seconds": 46.19,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "Is there anything else with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 47.93,
      "end_seconds": 52.39,
      "duration_seconds": 4.46,
      "text": "Uh, it usually comes with an irregular heartbeat."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 54.24,
      "end_seconds": 56.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "Have you been losing weight?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 57.41,
      "end_seconds": 72.44,
      "duration_seconds": 15.03,
      "text": "Yes, about the same, five days. As for irregular heartbeat, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.22,
      "end_seconds": 77.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "Have you noticed heat intolerance, sweating, diarrhoea or tremor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.39,
      "end_seconds": 81.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "No, not a single one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.43,
      "end_seconds": 88.15,
      "duration_seconds": 4.72,
      "text": "Have you noticed any weakness, or anything odd with your balance?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 89.66,
      "end_seconds": 91.64,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "No, that's all normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 93.46,
      "end_seconds": 97.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "What about your tummy and bowels, anything unusual there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.12,
      "end_seconds": 102.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.94,
      "text": "Um, no, all normal there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 109.08,
      "end_seconds": 111.07,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "And alcohol, how much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.4,
      "end_seconds": 115.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.59,
      "text": "I'll have a glass of wine with dinner."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.2,
      "end_seconds": 118.79,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "Okay, any smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.59,
      "end_seconds": 122.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "No, I've never smoked in my life."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 127.28,
      "end_seconds": 130.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "Are you in work at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 131.92,
      "end_seconds": 136.38,
      "duration_seconds": 4.46,
      "text": "Yes, I work in a bakery, early starts."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 137.71,
      "end_seconds": 139.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "Tell me about your eating."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 140.95,
      "end_seconds": 146.2,
      "duration_seconds": 5.25,
      "text": "I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 147.07,
      "end_seconds": 149.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "So, is there someone at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 150.25,
      "end_seconds": 153.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "My husband and I live above the shop."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.09,
      "end_seconds": 158.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "Is there anything relevant on the family side?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.18,
      "end_seconds": 162.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "Yeah, my grandfather had a stroke."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.85,
      "end_seconds": 174.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "Any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 175.51,
      "end_seconds": 176.64,
      "duration_seconds": 1.13,
      "text": "Yes, eczema."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 178.33,
      "end_seconds": 180.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "Let's run through your medicines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 182.47,
      "end_seconds": 191.46,
      "duration_seconds": 8.99,
      "text": "Right, I'm on hydrocortisone cream, when needed for the eczema. I'm hoping you can tell me something definite."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.86,
      "end_seconds": 203.99,
      "duration_seconds": 4.13,
      "text": "Do you react to any medicines or foods? Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 205.55,
      "end_seconds": 209.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "Yes, milk, it gives me stomach cramps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 210.48,
      "end_seconds": 213.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.11,
      "text": "Shall I check your blood pressure and pulse?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.54,
      "end_seconds": 231.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "Alright, that's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 245.17,
      "end_seconds": 252.99,
      "duration_seconds": 7.82,
      "text": "Okay: SpO2 97 percent on room air, BP is 120 over 84, pulse is 105 beats a minute."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 254.8,
      "end_seconds": 256.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "Is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 257.61,
      "end_seconds": 261.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "They help me see the whole picture, more shortly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 263.66,
      "end_seconds": 265.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "Shall I start the examination?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.83,
      "end_seconds": 269.2,
      "duration_seconds": 1.37,
      "text": "Does that hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 280.99,
      "end_seconds": 286.45,
      "duration_seconds": 5.46,
      "text": "Your pulse is fast and irregular and the thyroid feels slightly enlarged."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 292.34,
      "end_seconds": 306.47,
      "duration_seconds": 14.13,
      "text": "Thank you, you can get dressed. So where does that leave us? This looks most like an overactive thyroid with atrial fibrillation, in an apathetic older patient. I'd also keep depression in mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 307.18,
      "end_seconds": 310.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "Is there something to worry about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 311.06,
      "end_seconds": 326.6,
      "duration_seconds": 15.54,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like an overactive thyroid with atrial fibrillation, in an apathetic older patient, but I'd like to confirm. I'm sending you for an ECG because of irregular pulse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 327.82,
      "end_seconds": 330.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "Okay, um, I'll do it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 332.15,
      "end_seconds": 352.65,
      "duration_seconds": 20.5,
      "text": "It is easy to miss in older people because they seem sleepy rather than hot and shaky. A short walk every day, even twenty minutes, will help more than you'd think. The thing that would worry me is if the symptoms get worse. If that happens, go to emergency."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 353.86,
      "end_seconds": 356.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.28,
      "text": "Thank you, that's clear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 357.09,
      "end_seconds": 365.09,
      "duration_seconds": 8.0,
      "text": "I'll want another look after the results. Is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 368.06,
      "end_seconds": 371.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "Right, I'll do that. Thank you, doctor."
    }
  ]
}